  "description": "The Stylus is a true hardtail bruiser. Versatile, confident, and ready to take on everything from long trail missions to technical, high-impact lines. Built around a 160mm fork with a slack front end and now running a mullet wheel setup (29\" front, 27.5\" rear), it offers the perfect balance of rollover speed and agility. A new headtube gusset adds extra strength where it counts, while the 12mm Boost 148 through-axle rear end and Chromag’s signature yokel chainstay provide generous tire clearance. With a compact seattube for low standover and room to slam your post, the Stylus stays out of the way when you need to move around on rough terrain or through DJ lines. It climbs with purpose, descends with authority, and takes a beating without flinching. The Stylus is built for riders who treat the mountain like a playground.",
